<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Orbital seeks share trading halt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Orbital seeks share trading halt.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orbital Engine Corp Ltd said on Wednesday it had been granted a trading halt on its shares ahead of an expected announcement to the market on Thursday.</p>
<p>The high-technology engine maker said it had sought the trading halt pending the finalisation of negotiations, which it did not outline.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
